    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u4E0D\u8D70\u5417\uFF1F\u90A3\u5C31\u542C\u597D\u4E86\u3002"
    en: Not leaving? Then listen carefully.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 0
    expression: 1
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
    uncomfortType: 0
    audioEffect: 0
  - cn: "\u524D\u671F\u7E41\u7410\u7684\u8BA1\u7B97\u4E0E\u626B\u63CF\u6211\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5B8C\u6210\u4E86\uFF0C\u4F60\u73B0\u5728\u770B\u5230\u7684\u662F\u7ECF\u8FC7\u7B80\u5316\u7684\u6536\u5C3E\u5DE5\u4F5C\u3002"
    en: I've already finished all the tedious initial calculations and scans. What
      you're seeing now is the simplified wrap-up work.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 0
